Description: Host installer for a ContinuumDAO MPA wallet node on Ubuntu
 Installs Docker and the other host packages, plus the Continuum install
 scripts, on Ubuntu. Installing this package does not create a node. After
 apt finishes, run mpa-wallet-install with a management key and the machine's
 public IPv4.
